<title>UK: Quebec's SQAE sets 3.0 bln Lux franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Quebec's SQAE sets 3.0 bln Lux franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and Credit Communal/Gemeenten.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE QUEBECOISE D'ASSAINISSEMENT DES EAUX</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PROVINCE OF QUEBEC</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    27.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.07 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    QUEBEC    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
